flowchart TD
    %% XAI (SHAP) Explanation Generation Flow
    
    Start([User Requests Explanation]) --> Input["Input Data<br/>• User profile<br/>• Predicted career<br/>• Model output"]
    
    Input --> LoadModel["Load Model & Data<br/>• career_model.pkl<br/>• Feature encoders<br/>• Background dataset"]
    
    LoadModel --> SelectExplainer{Choose Explainer}
    
    SelectExplainer -->|Tree-based| TreeExp["TreeExplainer<br/>Fast exact computation<br/>100-1000x faster<br/>For MLP as tree proxy"]
    SelectExplainer -->|Model-agnostic| KernelExp["KernelExplainer<br/>Sample 2000+ coalitions<br/>Weighted regression<br/>Fallback method"]
    
    TreeExp --> ComputeSHAP["Compute SHAP Values<br/>Shapley value formula:<br/>φᵢ = Σ contribution<br/>across all coalitions"]
    KernelExp --> ComputeSHAP
    
    ComputeSHAP --> BaseValue["Calculate Base Value<br/>Average model output<br/>across background data"]
    
    BaseValue --> Attribution["Feature Attribution<br/>• Positive SHAP → increases prob<br/>• Negative SHAP → decreases prob<br/>• Magnitude → importance"]
    
    Attribution --> RankFeatures["Rank Features<br/>Sort by |SHAP value|<br/>Top 10 most important"]
    
    RankFeatures --> GenViz["Generate Visualizations<br/>• Force plot (single)<br/>• Waterfall plot<br/>• Bar plot (mean)"]
    
    GenViz --> SavePlot["Save Plot<br/>backend/static/<br/>shap_explanation.png<br/>Base64 encoding"]
    
    SavePlot --> NLG["Natural Language Generation<br/>Convert SHAP to text:<br/>'Your strength in [feature]<br/>contributes X% to this role'"]
    
    NLG --> Confidence["Calculate Confidence<br/>Prediction probability<br/>Very High (>80%)<br/>High (60-80%)<br/>Moderate (40-60%)"]
    
    Confidence --> Counterfactual{Generate<br/>Counterfactual?}
    
    Counterfactual -->|Yes| WhatIf["What-If Analysis<br/>SHAP difference:<br/>target - current<br/>Top 3 changes needed"]
    Counterfactual -->|No| Format
    
    WhatIf --> Actionable["Actionable Advice<br/>'Increase X by Y points'<br/>'Add certification Z'<br/>Priority ranking"]
    
    Actionable --> Format["Format Response<br/>• SHAP values (JSON)<br/>• Plot URL/Base64<br/>• Text insights<br/>• Counterfactuals"]
    
    Format --> End([Return XAI Response])
    
